              language: "eng",
              name: "Scrumptious Taco Rolls",
              description:
                'Nothing says party time like taquitos. Personally, we love some creamy <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/creamy-jalapeno-chicken-taquitos">jalapeño chicken taquitos</a>. And we find it hard to back away from a plate of taco egg rolls. If you really want to mix things up, opt for our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/buffalo-n-ranch-taquitos">buffalo and ranch taquitos</a>. No matter what mood you\'re in, we\'ve got taquitos to satisfy your craving. ',
