      description:
        'Mexican food is always packed with tons of flavor and deliciousness. From street food to fine-dining, Mexican dishes are zesty, fun and a must-eat for everyone! Make our <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/huevos-rancheros-ish-bake">Huevos Rancheros</a> for a hearty breakfast or go fancy with the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/steak-fajita-quesadillas">steak fajita quesadillas</a>. These recipes are guaranteed to create a fiesta in your mouth! ',
