              description:
                'If you\'re ready for a fiesta, well, then, you\'re in for a treat! We have a handpicked list of recipes inspired by Mexican dishes that you will absolutely love! Give a fancy twist to your plain-Jane tacos and test out these <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/crunchy-taco-cups">Crunchy Taco Cups</a>! For a sweeter surprise, you have to try the <a href="https://tasty.co/recipe/dulce-de-leche-lava-cake">Dulce De Leche Lava Cake</a>. We bet it\'ll tickle your tastebuds in all the right ways! It may not be Cinco de Mayo, but who needs an excuse to party anyways?',
